    "title": "Can I Win",
    "category": "Mathematics - Game Theory",
    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "problemStatement": "Two players alternately choose distinct integers from 1 to maxChoosableInteger. The chosen numbers are accumulated, and the player whose total first reaches or exceeds desiredTotal wins. Determine whether the first player can force a win.",
